<div class="report-overview"><section class="score-card panel"><span class="eyebrow">ÇEKİRDEK KRİTER KAPSAMI</span><div class="big-score"><?= (int)$a['score'] ?><small>/100</small></div><h2>Örüntü kapsam skoru</h2><p>6 çekirdek kriterde ağırlıklı eşleşme.<br>Hukuki uyumluluk puanı değildir.</p></section><section class="panel report-summary"><span class="eyebrow">BİR BAKIŞTA SONUÇLAR</span><h2>Her bulgu bir inceleme başlangıcı.</h2><div class="finding-stats"><div><strong class="good"><?= $found ?></strong><span>Bulgu var</span></div><div><strong class="medium"><?= 8-$found-$missing ?></strong><span>Kısmi bulgu</span></div><div><strong class="low"><?= $missing ?></strong><span>Bulgu yok</span></div></div><div class="metrics"><span><strong><?= (int)$r['metrics']['words'] ?></strong> kelime</span><span><strong><?= (int)$r['metrics']['sentences'] ?></strong> cümle</span><span><strong><?= e($r['metrics']['average_sentence']) ?></strong> kelime / cümle</span><span><strong>~<?= (int)$r['metrics']['reading_minutes'] ?> dk</strong> okuma</span></div></section></div>
